        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Park Sung-woong, Hong Won-chan, Go Ah-sung\n- Works: No. 3, New World, The Deal, Office\n- Roles: actor, gangster, serial killer, director\n- Topics: South Korean film and television\n\nFacts:\n- Park Sung-woong was born on January 9, 1973, and he is a South Korean actor.\n- Park Sung-woong made his acting debut in the film No. 3 in 1997.\n- Park Sung-woong later starred in several movies and television series.\n- Park Sung-woong notably played a gangster in New World in 2013.\n- Office is a 2015 South Korean slasher-thriller film directed by Hong Won-chan.\n- Office stars Go Ah-sung and Park Sung-woong.\n- Park Sung-woong notably played a serial killer in The Deal in 2015.",
